    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2610090/extras/763a239eb00c651e92ac88b686697559.avif?t=1754671214\" width=600 height=192 /></span><br><br>Welcome to 'A Park Full of Cats,' a hidden object game that invites you to revel in the enchanting world of amusement parks! Experience the thrill and excitement of the rides and give those cats the fun they truly deserve!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2610090/extras/88c349ea5e3e3b06cc4821bfe64d270a.poster.avif?t=1754671214\" width=620 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2610090/extras/88c349ea5e3e3b06cc4821bfe64d270a.webm?t=1754671214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2610090/extras/88c349ea5e3e3b06cc4821bfe64d270a.mp4?t=1754671214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>At the center of the park, Fofi\u00f1o takes the stage! Search for the cats that'll join him in making this an unforgettable show!  Explore every nook and cranny, from the Roller Coasters to the Bumper Cars and the towering Ferris Wheels, to find these playful cats!<br><br>&quot;A Park Full of Cats&quot; features:<br><br>One Enormous Scenario: Immerse yourself in a vast, single-screen scenario, brimming with hidden cats. It's the largest and most intricately designed setting we've created, ensuring you have plenty to explore.<br><br>Fun and Games: Experience the amusement park like never before as you locate hidden cats and unlock new achievements. The thrill of the rides is just a click away!<br><br>Free Admission: 'A Park Full of Cats' is not only an amusement park for cats but also for players. The ticket to this adventure is absolutely FREE, giving everyone a chance to have fun and find all the cats without any cost.<br><br>Countless Cats: As you delve into the world of amusement, you'll encounter a plethora of playful feline companions, each with their unique charm. Can you find them all?<br><br>So, grab your virtual ticket, hop on the rides, and embark on an unforgettable adventure at 'A Park Full of Cats.'. Get ready to enjoy a day at the amusement park and discover the magic that happens when cats have their own playground!",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2610090/extras/763a239eb00c651e92ac88b686697559.avif?t=1754671214\" width=600 height=192 /></span><br><br>Welcome to 'A Park Full of Cats,' a hidden object game that invites you to revel in the enchanting world of amusement parks! Experience the thrill and excitement of the rides and give those cats the fun they truly deserve!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2610090/extras/88c349ea5e3e3b06cc4821bfe64d270a.poster.avif?t=1754671214\" width=620 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2610090/extras/88c349ea5e3e3b06cc4821bfe64d270a.webm?t=1754671214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2610090/extras/88c349ea5e3e3b06cc4821bfe64d270a.mp4?t=1754671214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>At the center of the park, Fofi\u00f1o takes the stage! Search for the cats that'll join him in making this an unforgettable show!  Explore every nook and cranny, from the Roller Coasters to the Bumper Cars and the towering Ferris Wheels, to find these playful cats!<br><br>&quot;A Park Full of Cats&quot; features:<br><br>One Enormous Scenario: Immerse yourself in a vast, single-screen scenario, brimming with hidden cats. It's the largest and most intricately designed setting we've created, ensuring you have plenty to explore.<br><br>Fun and Games: Experience the amusement park like never before as you locate hidden cats and unlock new achievements. The thrill of the rides is just a click away!<br><br>Free Admission: 'A Park Full of Cats' is not only an amusement park for cats but also for players. The ticket to this adventure is absolutely FREE, giving everyone a chance to have fun and find all the cats without any cost.<br><br>Countless Cats: As you delve into the world of amusement, you'll encounter a plethora of playful feline companions, each with their unique charm. Can you find them all?<br><br>So, grab your virtual ticket, hop on the rides, and embark on an unforgettable adventure at 'A Park Full of Cats.'. Get ready to enjoy a day at the amusement park and discover the magic that happens when cats have their own playground!",
